# Scacelith - Tiếng Việt
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Vietnamese has a single plural form: a
# noun after a number never changes ("1 nước", "3 nước").
# Register: Vietnamese software (Microsoft, Apple): buttons, tabs and titles are short verbs or nouns
# with no pronoun; the player is "bạn" when a pronoun is needed. Piece names are capitalised (Vua, Hậu,
# Xe, Tượng, Mã, Tốt), and so are the sides as players (Trắng, Đen). Titles in capitals, every
# diacritic kept. Time controls: Cờ siêu chớp (bullet), Cờ chớp (blitz), Cờ nhanh (rapid), Cờ tiêu
# chuẩn (classical). "Friend" is "người bạn" / "bạn bè" (never "bạn của bạn"). Terms: glossary/vi.md.
# Keep the sections: other parts of the game add their keys in sections of their own.

